412 Spring 2025 Project

How to run the API server and the Project.

1. cd Server
2. run: nano .env
    Make sure to put your database login information

    PGUSER=your_username
    PGPASSWORD=your_password
    PGHOST=/tmp
    PGPORT=8888
    PGDATABASE=your_database_name

3. run: npm install
    in server directory
4. run: node index.js
    this should run the server
5. now: cd 412-react-stockwatchlist
6. run: npm install
7. run: npm start

